desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "python"
	title: "结构扫描：Python XPath 拼接"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Python XPath 拼接"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-python-xpath-query"
	risk: "xpath-injection"
	cwe: "CWE-643"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
把外部字符串拼进 XPath 可以改变查询条件，读到未授权节点。

### 风险类型
xpath-injection

### 影响
命中说明编译单元里出现了该调用，而不是注释或字符串。

### 检测方式
结构扫描匹配真实调用。
### 参考
- CWE-643
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用 XPath 变量绑定，或对引号和括号做严格转义。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://bad.py": <<<POS
def bad(tree, name):
    return tree.xpath(name)

POS
	"safefile://ok.py": <<<NEG
def ok():
    return 1

NEG
)
xpath as $call
xpath(* as $arg) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "结构扫描：Python XPath 拼接",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Python XPath 拼接",
	message: "结构扫描：Python XPath 拼接",
	risk: "xpath-injection",
}
